01:27:06.811 --> 01:27:08.991
anymore. Dynamical systems,

01:27:08.991 --> 01:27:11.171
whether it's the human body or any systems

01:27:11.681 --> 01:27:13.151
that we need to study

01:27:13.711 --> 01:27:15.251
understand causal effects or interventions,

01:27:16.361 --> 01:27:18.519
is a dynamical system. So the question

01:27:18.520 --> 01:27:20.060
that appear to us is,

01:27:21.441 --> 01:27:23.841
can we do trustworthy treatment effect

01:27:23.841 --> 01:27:25.921
