01:27:37.041 --> 01:27:39.301
together with my PhD student, Juliana Pichstortz,

01:27:39.491 --> 01:27:41.841
and Shostov. And

01:27:41.841 --> 01:27:43.921
what we would like to do is we would like to

01:27:43.921 --> 01:27:46.091
understand how long does it take for

01:27:46.091 --> 01:27:47.901
the treatment effect to exceed

01:27:48.461 --> 01:27:50.571
some threshold? For instance,

01:27:50.571 --> 01:27:52.431
some biomarker that we are worried

01:27:52.651 --> 01:27:54.811
