06:48:28.556 --> 06:48:30.887
linear form. This is typically called as

06:48:31.017 --> 06:48:33.217
the main effects. And then there is this

06:48:33.217 --> 06:48:34.977
higher order interaction effects.

06:48:35.617 --> 06:48:37.697
Where these will be basically capturing a lot

06:48:37.697 --> 06:48:39.817
